  "steps": [
    "The bank's loan system asks for a score through the bank's own API gateway.",
    "The request leaves over a private, encrypted link (mutual TLS) from known addresses, and is signed.",
    "The edge blocks bad traffic, checks identity, quotas, schema and replays, and turns the bank's format into ours.",
    "A known site is answered from cache or stored observations within the target time.",
    "A new site becomes a queued job; autoscaled workers write the observations.",
    "When a label changes, a signed webhook goes back over the secure link, with retries and a dead-letter queue.",
    "Every access is written to an immutable audit log and watched, while keys, retention and erasure are handled in the data and trust zones."
  ]
}